  "description": "There is a land where elves and wizards roam, where warriors and demon kings clash for the fate of the world—and the name of this fantastical land is none other than… Seoul, South Korea?! Sent by magic from his fantasy world to modern Seoul along with his party of colorful heroes, will former warrior and very ordinary student Hui-Won be able to gather his party and save it from the “evils” of the Demon King?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
